"08a15d8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"How do I get an appointment at \\u201cSpiritual Touch\\u201d?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Please make an appointment by phone or Whatsapp at +49 1578 150 4469<\\/p>\\n<p>Alternatively by e-mail to&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:info@spiritual-touch.de\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\\\">info@spiritual-touch.de<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>Or use the&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/buchungsformular\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\\\">contact form<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>It is better to book a few days in advance - appointments can often be arranged at short notice.<\\/p>\\n<p>Please do not drop by unannounced!<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"c4cd152\"},{\"tab_title\":\"What are the opening hours?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>We are open for you from Monday to Sunday. However, we are only on site at agreed times. The appointments can start between 09:00 and 19:00.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"cfa9800\"},{\"_id\":\"099482a\",\"tab_title\":\"Where does the massage take place? - Are there also home and hotel visits?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>No. In order to be able to give you a professional tantric massage, the massage takes place in the Spiritual Touch practice.<\\/p><p>The address is:<\\/p><p>Olschewskibogen 12<br \\/>80935 M\\u00fcnchen<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"bab0d83\",\"tab_title\":\"How can I pay?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>You can generally pay in cash. Paypal, EC or credit card payment is also possible with some practitioners.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"6584656\",\"tab_title\":\"Who will give me a massage?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>You can choose a practitioner from our team and request an appointment by phone or email.<br \\/>You will then be informed whether the appointment is possible, who is available as an alternative or when your preferred masseuse\\/masseur is available for you again.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"3526031\",\"tab_title\":\"Do I need to bring anything with me for my treatment? \",\"tab_content\":\"<p>No, on the contrary! Leave as much of your everyday life at home as possible.<\\/p><p>All you need to bring for your treatment is yourself and the fee for your treatment. Towels, lughis, oil etc. are all on site.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"db31a50\",\"tab_title\":\"What happens if I am late or have to cancel?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Please arrive on time for your treatment. For organizational reasons, we cannot let you into the practice before your treatment appointment, as the practice does not have a waiting area. Please inform your dentist in good time if you will be late so that other appointments can be coordinated. If your delay cannot be coordinated with subsequent appointments, the delay will be deducted from your massage time. Please bear in mind that the practitioners have booked the room for your treatment and may incur unnecessary costs if you are late. Please refer to the cancellation conditions for appointments in the terms and conditions<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ff8673e\",\"tab_title\":\"Is the practitioner naked?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Yes, we want to meet at eye level. In the tantric ritual, man (Shiva) and woman (Shakti) meet.<br \\/>Status and everyday life are set aside with clothing.<br \\/>We do not want to be suggestive or provocative, but rather open ourselves to closeness, knowledge and being touched.<br \\/>Being naked is seen as something natural and beautiful.<\\/p><p>However, if this is an overdose for you, please talk to us and we will find a way.<\\/p><p>During a sexual coaching or sexological bodywork session, we always remain clothed.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ffa0cab\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I touch the practitioners?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Basically not. There may be moments when your hand is guided. Remember that we want to give you a wonderful experience. We feel free and exuberant in our intuition when we can trust you not to be touched arbitrarily.<br \\/>Trust our art and our skills.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ceae005\",\"tab_title\":\"Can a tantric massage become \\u201cmore\\u201d or are there secret \\u201cextras\\u201d?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>No. Our work is about a holistic tantric massage ritual. We do not offer sexual intercourse or other sexual exchange.<br \\/>We touch body, mind and soul. You are invited to lean back and open yourself to your perceptions. We invite you to enjoy your time by surrendering to your inner world of experience.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"a59adcf\",\"tab_title\":\"I have never experienced an orgasm as a woman, can a tantric massage help me?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>In a relationship-free setting without expectations, we want to create a safe space to allow sensual feelings or to perceive them as such. The yoni massage begins slowly. You have at least 2 hours to feel inside yourself.<br \\/>This creates a space in which it is possible to observe what is really happening - regardless of what should be happening. This can open doors for an orgasmic experience.<\\/p><p>In addition, some team members also offer sexological bodywork or somatic sexual counseling. Conscious research can also be explored in these rooms.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"a8499c2\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I receive a yoni massage while I am menstruating?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Yes, that is possible from our side. But the decision is up to you.<br \\/>This situation can be very intimate. We recommend soft tampons during the massage. It is also good to inform the practitioner so that you can be completely open about it.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"6440bda\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I give my wife\\/husband a tantric massage if she\\/he has problems with her\\/his sexuality?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Basically, a tantric massage is a wonderful gift to a partner. It can be a valuable enrichment for the relationship and the autonomous sexuality of both partners.<br \\/>The tantric massage itself is not a therapy, but an experience. <br \\/>For further exploration of sexuality and relationship dynamics, we recommend somatic counseling or sexological bodywork as a couple or individually<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"e4b1775\",\"tab_title\":\"I suffer from premature ejaculation. Can tantric massage help me?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Premature ejaculation is often not a functional disorder, but rather an experiential disorder.<br \\/>This is why it can be consciously addressed in tantric massage.<\\/p><p>In addition, some team members also offer sexological bodywork, somatic sexual counseling or couples counseling. Conscious research can also be carried out in these rooms.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"bd4a453\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I shower in the practice before my treatment?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>The studio has a bathroom with a shower. You can shower before and after your session.<\\/p>\"}],\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"toggle\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f3fdf08\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"40d6ab3\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"baf2cea\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e8c3519\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(18976,20294,'_eael_custom_js',''),(18977,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(18978,20294,'_edit_last','1'),(18979,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minute