 can generally pay in cash. Paypal, EC or credit card payment is also possible with some practitioners.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"6584656\",\"tab_title\":\"Who will give me a massage?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>You can choose a practitioner from our team and request an appointment by phone or email.<br \\/>You will then be informed whether the appointment is possible, who is available as an alternative or when your preferred masseuse\\/masseur is available for you again.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"3526031\",\"tab_title\":\"Do I need to bring anything with me for my treatment? \",\"tab_content\":\"<p>No, on the contrary! Leave as much of your everyday life at home as possible.<\\/p><p>All you need to bring for your treatment is yourself and the fee for your treatment. Towels, lughis, oil etc. are all on site.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"db31a50\",\"tab_title\":\"What happens if I am late or have to cancel?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Please arrive on time for your treatment. For organizational reasons, we cannot let you into the practice before your treatment appointment, as the practice does not have a waiting area. Please inform your dentist in good time if you will be late so that other appointments can be coordinated. If your delay cannot be coordinated with subsequent appointments, the delay will be deducted from your massage time. Please bear in mind that the practitioners have booked the room for your treatment and may incur unnecessary costs if you are late. Please refer to the cancellation conditions for appointments in the terms and conditions<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ff8673e\",\"tab_title\":\"Is the practitioner naked?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Yes, we want to meet at eye level. In the tantric ritual, man (Shiva) and woman (Shakti) meet.<br \\/>Status and everyday life are set aside with clothing.<br \\/>We do not want to be suggestive or provocative, but rather open ourselves to closeness, knowledge and being touched.<br \\/>Being naked is seen as something natural and beautiful.<\\/p><p>However, if this is an overdose for you, please talk to us and we will find a way.<\\/p><p>During a sexual coaching or sexological bodywork session, we always remain clothed.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ffa0cab\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I touch the practitioners?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Basically not. There may be moments when your hand is guided. Remember that we want to give you a wonderful experience. We feel free and exuberant in our intuition when we can trust you not to be touched arbitrarily.<br \\/>Trust our art and our skills.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ceae005\",\"tab_title\":\"Can a tantric massage become \\u201cmore\\u201d or are there secret \\u201cextras\\u201d?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>No. Our work is about a holistic tantric massage ritual. We do not offer sexual intercourse or other sexual exchange.<br \\/>We touch body, mind and soul. You are invited to lean back and open yourself to your perceptions. We invite you to enjoy your time by surrendering to your inner world of experience.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"a59adcf\",\"tab_title\":\"I have never experienced an orgasm as a woman, can a tantric massage help me?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>In a relationship-free setting without expectations, we want to create a safe space to allow sensual feelings or to perceive them as such. The yoni massage begins slowly. You have at least 2 hours to feel inside yourself.<br \\/>This creates a space in which it is possible to observe what is really happening - regardless of what should be happening. This can open doors for an orgasmic experience.<\\/p><p>In addition, some team members also offer sexological bodywork or somatic sexual counseling. Conscious research can also be explored in these rooms.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"a8499c2\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I receive a yoni massage while I am menstruating?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Yes, that is possible from our side. But the decision is up to you.<br \\/>This situation can be very intimate. We recommend soft tampons during the massage. It is also good to inform the practitioner so that you can be completely open about it.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"6440bda\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I give my wife\\/husband a tantric massage if she\\/he has problems with her\\/his sexuality?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Basically, a tantric massage is a wonderful gift to a partner. It can be a valuable enrichment for the relationship and the autonomous sexuality of both partners.<br \\/>The tantric massage itself is not a therapy, but an experience. <br \\/>For further exploration of sexuality and relationship dynamics, we recommend somatic counseling or sexological bodywork as a couple or individually<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"e4b1775\",\"tab_title\":\"I suffer from premature ejaculation. Can tantric massage help me?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Premature ejaculation is often not a functional disorder, but rather an experiential disorder.<br \\/>This is why it can be consciously addressed in tantric massage.<\\/p><p>In addition, some team members also offer sexological bodywork, somatic sexual counseling or couples counseling. Conscious research can also be carried out in these rooms.<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"bd4a453\",\"tab_title\":\"Can I shower in the practice before my treatment?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>The studio has a bathroom with a shower. You can shower before and after your session.<\\/p>\"}],\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"toggle\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f3fdf08\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"40d6ab3\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"baf2cea\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e8c3519\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(18989,20294,'_eael_custom_js',''),(18990,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(18991,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','FAQ Tantramassage München'),(18992,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Hier beantworten wir dir alle Fragen zur Tantramassage.'),(18993,20294,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','54'),(18995,20294,'_last_editor_used_jetpack','block-editor'),(18996,20294,'_tribe_ticket_capacity','0'),(18997,20294,'_tribe_ticket_version','5.8.3'),(18998,20294,'_oembed_b72f3126dfcc38df7fd662e6bb9b91d1','{{unknown}}'),(19012,20297,'_edit_lock','1735997691:1'),(19013,20297,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(19014,20297,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(19015,20297,'_elementor_version','3.26.3'),(19016,20297,'_elementor_pro_version','3.26.2'),(19017,20297,'_oembed_b72f3126dfcc38df7fd662e6bb9b91d1','{{unknown}}'),(19018,20299,'_wp_attached_file','2024/08/2.png'),(19019,20299,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:500;s:6:\"height\";i:500;s:4:\"file\";s:13:\"2024/08/2.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:25004;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:13:\"2-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2448;}s:21:\"woocommerce_thumbnail\";a:6:{s:4:\"file\";s:13:\"2-450x450.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:450;s:6:\"height\";i:450;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11195;s:9:\"uncropped\";b:0;}s:29:\"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:13:\"2-100x100.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:100;s:6:\"height\";i:100;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:1384;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(19020,20297,'_wp_page_template','default'),(19021,20297,'_elementor_page_settings','a:2:{s:20:\"ep_grid_line_columns\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"eael_ext_toc_title\";s:17:\"Table of Contents\";}'),(19022,20297,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"ff5bc50\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"065aa1f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/09\\/3-Kopie.png\",\"id\":20601,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"medium\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6c0dbd3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"8066f29\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"f4db863\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d2e77b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Die Reise beginnt...\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#961310\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"614de95\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"bf4a0de\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"fb8b624\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"559b080\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Ein tantrischer Begegnungsabend f\\u00fcr Einsteiger\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"center\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"85ed618\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Im \\\"<strong>Heart Circle 1<\\/strong>\\\" bieten wir Dir einen Raum, in dem Du Dir selbst und anderen Menschen authentisch &amp; transparent begegnen kannst.\\u00a0<strong><span style=\\\"letter-spacing: -0.27px; color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align); font-size: 1.8rem;\\\">Erlebe ein Prickeln, das nicht nur auf der Haut sp\\u00fcrbar ist!<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Hier kannst Du frei sein<\\/strong>, Deine Maske fallen zu lassen und Dich sp\\u00fcrbar machen. Mit unserer Anleitung begegnet Ihr Euch ehrlich und auf einer neuen Ebene. <strong>Ohne Alltag, ohne Rollen, ohne Erwartungen &amp; Verpflichtungen.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Wir laden Dich ein, den Raum <strong>tantrischer Begegnung<\\/strong> f\\u00fcr Dich zu erforschen und Dir ein Tor zu einer <strong>spannenden Reise<\\/strong> zu \\u00f6ffnen.\\u00a0<\\/p><p>In <strong>Langsamkeit<\\/strong> und einer <strong>liebevollen Umgebung<\\/strong> lernt Ihr Euch in kleinen Begegnungs\\u00fcbungen kennen. Mit diesem gewonnenen <strong>Vertrauen<\\/strong> f\\u00e4llt es Dir leicht, neugierig auf Dich selbst und andere zu sein.\\u00a0<\\/p><p><strong>Jederzeit laden wir Dich ein, gut f\\u00fcr Dich zu sorgen<\\/strong> und Dir ein \\\"ich brauche gerade\\\", \\\"ich m\\u00f6chte gerne\\\" oder auch ein \\\"ich will gerade nicht\\\" zu erlauben. <strong>Alles ist freiwillig<\\/strong> und wenn mal eine \\u00dcbung oder Begegnung f\\u00fcr Dich nicht stimmig ist, besteht die M\\u00f6glichkeit auszusetzen oder auch mal nur zuzuschauen.\\u00a0<\\/p><p>Auch generell m\\u00f6chten wir Dich erleben lassen, \\\"Nein\\\" sagen zu d\\u00fcrfen, ein erhaltenes \\\"Nein\\\" nicht pers\\u00f6nlich zu nehmen und sich \\u00fcber ein klares \\\"Ja\\\" zu freuen!<\\/p><p>Am Ende des Abends wirst Du gen\\u00e4hrt und verbunden in Deine Welt zur\\u00fcckkehren und Dein inneres Wohlbefinden weitertragen.<\\/p><p><strong>Der Abend ist offen f\\u00fcr alle Menschen:<\\/strong> Paare und Einzelpersonen sind gleicherma\\u00dfen willkommen. Bitte sei Dir bewusst, das wir nicht auf ein ausgewogenes Verh\\u00e4ltnis der Geschlechter achten und Du auch gleichgeschlechtliche \\u00dcbungen machen wirst.<\\/p><p><strong>Der komplette Abend findet bekleidet und ohne intimen k\\u00f6rperlichen Kontakt statt.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Weitere Informationen:<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Uhrzeiten:<\\/strong><br \\/>18:00 Uhr - 18:30 Uhr ankommen<br \\/>18:30 Uhr - 21:30 Uhr<\\/p><p><strong>Location:<\\/strong><br \\/>Praxis \\\"Spiritual Touch\\\"<br \\/>Olschewskibogen 12<br \\/>80935 M\\u00fcnchen<\\/p><p><strong>Mitbringliste:<\\/strong><br \\/>- verschlie\\u00dfbare Wasserflasche<br \\/>- bequeme Kleidung, in der Du Dich wohlf\\u00fchlst<br \\/>- ein Notizbuch und Schreibzeug<\\/p><p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"0967740\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"fdbe47b\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"b363068\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3ecb52f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"html\":\"<!-- Noscript content for added SEO -->\\r\\n<noscript><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.de\\/e\\/heart-circle-i-die-reise-beginnt-tickets-1134548468009\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Buy Tickets on Eventbrite<\\/a><\\/noscript>\\r\\n<!-- You can customize this button any way you like -->\\r\\n<button id=\\\"eventbrite-widget-modal-trigger-1134548468009\\\" type=\\\"button\\\">Zur Anmeldung<\\/button>\\r\\n\\r\\n<script src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.de\\/static\\/widgets\\/eb_widgets.js\\\"><\\/script>\\r\\n\\r\\n<script type=\\\"text\\/javascript\\\">\\r\\n    var exampleCallback = function() {\\r\\n        console.log(\'Order complete!\');\\r\\n    };\\r\\n\\r\\n    window.EBWidgets.createWidget({\\r\\n        widgetType: \'checkout\',\\r\\n        eventId: \'1134548468009\',\\r\\n        modal: true,\\r\\n        modalTriggerElementId: \'eventbrite-widget-modal-trigger-1134548468009\',\\r\\n        onOrderComplete: exampleCallback\\r\\n    });\\r\\n<\\/script>\",\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"47529fc\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"element_pack_agbg_color_list\":[{\"_id\":\"be025eb\"},{\"start_color\":\"#567445\",\"end_color\":\"#1D1BE0\",\"_id\":\"9ccc30c\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"753eeca\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(19039,20301,'_wp_attached_file','2024/08/Heart.png'),(19040,20301,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:500;s:6:\"height\";i:500;s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"2024/08/Heart.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:42949;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Heart-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:12540;}s:21:\"woocommerce_thumbnail\";a:6:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Heart-450x450.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:450;s:6:\"height\";i:450;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:51485;s:9:\"uncropped\";b:0;}s:29:\"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Heart-100x100.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:100;s:6:\"height\";i:100;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7172;}}s:10:\"