library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"boxed_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"boxed_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f189aa7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Your Journey to Self-Discovery\",\"align\":\"center\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Raleway\",\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\",\"left\":\"2\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=7b7d223\",\"_background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"04c496d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Trenner\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":75,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\",\"gap_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"0cf8062\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Tantra- &amp; Tao-Massage\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\",\"left\":\"2\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_border_color\":\"#961310\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=7b7d223\",\"_background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0ddb4e6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Step into a transformative ritual that honors your wholeness. Our Tantra massage blends the ancient wisdom of Neo-Tantra with Taoist principles, guiding you into deep, mindful touch. Through intentional, heart-centered contact, you\\u2019ll awaken a heightened sensuality and rediscover the freedom of your life force.<\\/p><p>By surrendering to this ritual, you may release shame and outdated beliefs around sexuality, clearing energetic blockages so that vitality flows unhindered.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"381\\\" data-end=\\\"777\\\">Originating in the 1980s, Neo-Tantra gave birth to this artful body-worship massage\\u2014a choreographed journey drawing on Yin-Yang balance, Indian tantra, classical techniques, reflexology, acupressure, shiatsu, Ayurveda, and bioenergetics.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"779\\\" data-end=\\\"1083\\\">Every session is unique: we improvise with creative, intuitive sequences that bring you into profound relaxation. In a safe, nurturing space, simply receive as we guide you deep into your being. Many guests experience meditative, trance-like states\\u2014prime for introspection and heartfelt transformation.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1085\\\" data-end=\\\"1522\\\">Performed on a comfortable futon, the treatment includes the entire unclothed body, inviting you to savor pure sensation. Ethical boundaries are honored at all times: you receive touch only, with no intention to induce sexual arousal or orgasm. A brief, 15-minute pre-session conversation clarifies boundaries and personal intentions. While we lead the ritual, you\\u2019re welcome to request the inclusion or exclusion of specific elements.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1524\\\" data-end=\\\"1539\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1524\\\" data-end=\\\"1537\\\">Benefits:<\\/strong><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\" data-end=\\\"1586\\\">Restored energy flow &amp; heightened vitality<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1589\\\" data-end=\\\"1622\\\">Deep relaxation &amp; stress relief<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1625\\\" data-end=\\\"1668\\\">Enhanced self-confidence &amp; body awareness<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1671\\\" data-end=\\\"1702\\\">Expanded, balanced sensuality<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1704\\\" data-end=\\\"1897\\\">Please allow an extra 30\\u201345 minutes beyond your chosen session length for pre- and post-session care, including private shower time and an optional, unrushed feedback chat\\u2014at no extra charge.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#961310\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\",\"left\":\"2\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_border_color\":\"#961310\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=7b7d223\",\"_background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6d38ca9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Bodyflow-Massage\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\",\"left\":\"2\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_border_color\":\"#961310\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=7b7d223\",\"_background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"72b836e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-end=\\\"530\\\">Experience the gentle harmony of flowing touch: At Spiritual Touch, our Bodyflow Massage is a luxurious treat that blends the wave-like grace of Hawaiian Lomi Lomi, the heart-opening presence of Tantra massage, and the deep-soothing effects of classic wellness techniques. Performed on a plush massage table, you\\u2019ll receive a perfectly choreographed sequence of long, fluid strokes, gentle pressure, and rhythmic movements designed to release tension and evoke a profound sense of comfort and expansiveness.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"532\\\" data-end=\\\"745\\\">Rest assured, the Bodyflow Massage is strictly non-intimate\\u2014there is no focus on the intimate zones\\u2014so you can fully relax without reservation and let your senses bask in purely nurturing, revitalizing sensations.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"747\\\" data-end=\\\"768\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"747\\\" data-end=\\\"766\\\">What to Expect:<\\/strong><\\/p><p data-start=\\\"771\\\" data-end=\\\"868\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"771\\\" data-end=\\\"793\\\">Flowing Movements:<\\/strong> Like soft ocean waves, our hands carry you into a state of deep release.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"871\\\" data-end=\\\"891\\\">Deep Relaxation:<\\/strong> Harmonious techniques calm your nervous system, melting away stress and tension.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"1099\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"977\\\" data-end=\\\"999\\\">Body-Mind Balance:<\\/strong> The blend of gentle pressure and intuitive rhythm guides you back to inner calm and centeredness.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1102\\\" data-end=\\\"1234\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1102\\\" data-end=\\\"1132\\\">Safe, Trusting Atmosphere:<\\/strong> In a nurturing environment, you\\u2019re invited to let go completely\\u2014no pressure, just loving mindfulness.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1236\\\" data-end=\\\"1471\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">Whether you\\u2019re curious about conscious touch or seeking a soothing interlude in your day, the Bodyflow Massage realigns body and mind, opening the door to renewed lightness and serenity. Book your escape with <strong data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1464\\\">Spiritual Touch<\\/strong> today!<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#961310\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\"