"id\":\"0cf8062\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Tantra- &amp; Tao-Massage\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\",\"left\":\"2\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_border_color\":\"#961310\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"_background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=7b7d223\",\"_background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0ddb4e6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Step into a transformative ritual that honors your wholeness. Our Tantra massage blends the ancient wisdom of Neo-Tantra with Taoist principles, guiding you into deep, mindful touch. Through intentional, heart-centered contact, you\\u2019ll awaken a heightened sensuality and rediscover the freedom of your life force.<\\/p><p>By surrendering to this ritual, you may release shame and outdated beliefs around sexuality, clearing energetic blockages so that vitality flows unhindered.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"381\\\" data-end=\\\"777\\\">Originating in the 1980s, Neo-Tantra gave birth to this artful body-worship massage\\u2014a choreographed journey drawing on Yin-Yang balance, Indian tantra, classical techniques, reflexology, acupressure, shiatsu, Ayurveda, and bioenergetics.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"779\\\" data-end=\\\"1083\\\">Every session is unique: we improvise with creative, intuitive sequences that bring you into profound relaxation. In a safe, nurturing space, simply receive as we guide you deep into your being. Many guests experience meditative, trance-like states\\u2014prime for introspection and heartfelt transformation.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1085\\\" data-end=\\\"1522\\\">Performed on a comfortable futon, the treatment includes the entire unclothed body, inviting you to savor pure sensation. Ethical boundaries are honored at all times: you receive touch only, with no intention to induce sexual arousal or orgasm. A brief, 15-minute pre-session conversation clarifies boundaries and personal intentions. While we lead the ritual, you\\u2019re welcome to request the inclusion or exclusion of specific elements.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1524\\\" data-end=\\\"1539\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1524\\\" data-end=\\\"1537\\\">Benefits:<\\/strong><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\" data-end=\\\"1586\\\">Restored energy flow &amp; heightened vitality<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1589\\\" data-end=\\\"1622\\\">Deep relaxation &amp; stress relief<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1625\\\" data-end=\\\"1668\\\">Enhanced self-confidence &amp; body awareness<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1671\\\" data-end=\\\"1702\\\">Expanded, balanced sensuality<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"1704\\\" data-end=\\\"1897\\\">Please allow an extra 30\\u201345 minutes beyond your chosen session length for pre- and post-session care, including private shower time and an optional, unrushed feedback chat\\u2014at no extra charge.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#961310\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_width_mobile\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":95,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"2\",\"right\":\"2\",\"bottom\":\"2\