"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e280718\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Somatisches Coaching\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"26cbc76\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Gespr\\u00e4ch, K\\u00f6rperwahrnehmung und innere Prozesse greifen ineinander. Somatisches Coaching unterst\\u00fctzt dabei, k\\u00f6rperliche Signale zu verstehen, emotionale Muster zu integrieren und neue Handlungsr\\u00e4ume zu erschlie\\u00dfen.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"3eca0bf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/praxis\\/einzelarbeit\\/somatisches-coaching\\/\\\">Mehr lesen &gt;<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\",\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"cdb5783\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1592cdb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"De-Armouring & Sacred-Spot-Ritual\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0e5012b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Arbeit mit k\\u00f6rperlichen Spannungs- und Schutzmustern. \\u00dcber achtsame Ber\\u00fchrung, Atem und Pr\\u00e4senz k\\u00f6nnen sich festgehaltene Strukturen l\\u00f6sen und neue Empfindungsr\\u00e4ume entstehen.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"713dc11\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/praxis\\/einzelarbeit\\/de-armouring-sacred-spot\\/\\\">Mehr lesen &gt;<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\",\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"4e4f16d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2885b55\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Somatic Experiencing\\u00ae (SE)\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0a42585\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Ein gesch\\u00fctzter Raum f\\u00fcr Kl\\u00e4rung, Reflexion und Orientierung. Die Begleitung richtet sich an Menschen, die innere Themen vertiefen, \\u00dcberg\\u00e4nge bewusst gestalten oder sich selbst besser verstehen m\\u00f6chten.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ac3a739\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/praxis\\/einzelarbeit\\/somatic-experiencing\\/\\\">Mehr lesen &gt;<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\",\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"287ee26\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"facc863\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"F\\u00fcr \\u00e4ltere Menschen\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"d283aff\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>K\\u00f6rperarbeit und Begegnung jenseits von Leistungs- oder Jugendidealen. Dieses Angebot richtet sich an \\u00e4ltere Menschen, die Ber\\u00fchrung, N\\u00e4he und Lebendigkeit als Teil ihrer Lebensphase erfahren m\\u00f6chten.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"0995e55\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/praxis\\/einzelarbeit\\/tantramassage-fuer-aeltere-menschen\\/\\\">Mehr lesen &gt;<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\",\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"16a6cb4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"25\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3b57e70\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f5eef01\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"F\\u00fcr Menschen mit Einschr\\u00e4nkungen\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f00551e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Unsere Praxis ist offen f\\u00fcr Menschen mit kognitiven und k\\u00f6rperlichen Einschr\\u00e4nkungen. Wir kreieren einen wertsch\\u00e4tzenden Rahmen, der sich den individuellen Bed\\u00fcrfnissen anpasst<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"75f4590\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/spiritual-touch.de\\/besondere-th