 (20453, 1, '2024-08-26 17:16:25', '2024-08-26 15:16:25', '<a href="https://spiritual-touch.de/buchungsformular/">FeelExperience your tantric massageBook now!</a><a href="https://spiritual-touch.de/sexological-bodywork/">SenseExplore yourself\nin a sexological bodywork session Book now !</a><a href="https://spiritual-touch.de/events/">ExploreLearn the tantric massageBook now!</a>				\n							<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z"></path></svg>							Previous slide\n							<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z"></path></svg>							Next slide\n													<img width="500" height="500" src="https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart.png" alt="" srcset="https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart.png 500w, https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart-150x150.png 150w, https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart-450x450.png 450w, https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart-100x100.png 100w, https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Heart-45x45.png 45w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />													\n		<h3 style="text-align: center;">Discover a world full of sensuality and immerse yourself in a feeling of deep touch with our tantric massage in Munich.</h3><p>Experience the revitalizing energy that lets you return to your everyday life enriched and invigorated during a tantric massage. Carry the smile on your lips and the sparkle in your eyes as a reminder of this deeply human experience.</p><p>Let yourself be taken on an individual, passive and sensual journey to yourself, where you can be completely yourself and experience yourself as a holistic sensual-sexual being.</p><p>Our team consists of independent, well-trained and warm-hearted practitioners who offer you attentive and loving hands in our stylish and protected practice.</p><p>Some team members are also available for additional support beyond tantric massage with coaching, sexological bodywork and sexual therapy.</p><p>Expand your awareness through tantra seminars, tantra massage training and workshops, which round off the comprehensive range offered by the Spiritual Touch practice.</p><p>Enjoy your time with us!</p><p>Your team at Praxis <strong>Spiritual Touch</strong> - Tantra &amp; Tantra massage in Munich</p>		\n			<h2>Get to know us</h2>		\n								<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="04252c2" data-elementor-lightbox-title="Jörg Tantramassage München" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTkxOTUsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOlwvXC9zcGlyaXR1YWwtdG91Y2guZGVcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzAyXC9TY3JlZW5zaG90XzIwMjMtMDgtMDdfMTg1MjM5LXRyYW5zZm9ybWVkLWUxNzA3NDIxMTk5NDA5LmpwZWciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwNDI1MmMyIn0%3D" href="https://spiritual-touch.de/team/"><figure><img src="https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screenshot_2023-08-07_185239-transformed-e1707421199409.jpeg" alt="Jörg" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="04252c2" data-elementor-lightbox-title="Konstantin Tantramassage München" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTg4MDEsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOlwvXC9zcGlyaXR1YWwtdG91Y2guZGVcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzAyXC9Lb25zdGFudGluLTEzLW