mig anf\\u00fchlt \\u2014 kein Muss.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>","page":"previous_page","page_url_parameters":"","redirect":"","message_entry_preview_style":"basic","conditional_logic":"1","conditional_type":"go","conditionals":[[{"field":"26","operator":"==","value":"5"}],[{"field":"26","operator":"==","value":"4"}]]},"1":{"name":"Danke","type":"message","message":"<div style=\\"background: #F7EBD9; border: 1px solid #D1C7BE; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px;\\">\\r\\n<h2 style=\\"margin: 0 0 8px; color: #2e2a28;\\">Danke f\\u00fcr Deine Ehrlichkeit <span style=\\"color: #9a4a4a;\\">\\u2661<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0 0 4px; color: #4a4442;\\">Dein Feedback ist angekommen und flie\\u00dft direkt in unsere Arbeit ein. Falls etwas nicht gepasst hat, schreib uns gern direkt an <a style=\\"color: #5b4338;\\" href=\\"mailto:info@spiritual-touch.de\\">info@spiritual-touch.de<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\"margin: 20px 0 8px; color: #4a4442;\\">Und falls Du Deinen Eindruck \\u00f6ffentlich teilen magst:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\"margin: 8px 0 0;\\"><a style=\\"display: inline-block; margin: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #5B4338; color: #5b4338; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px;\\" href=\\"https:\\/\\/g.page\\/r\\/CQIdJg6r7j9fEBM\\/review\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Google (mit Namen) \\u2192 <\\/a> <a style=\\"display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 8px; padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #5B4338; color: #5b4338; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px;\\" href=\\"https:\\/\\/de.trustpilot.com\\/review\\/www.spiritual-touch.de\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Trustpilot (pseudonym) \\u2192 <\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>","message_scroll":"1","page":"previous_page","page_url_parameters":"","redirect":"","message_entry_preview_style":"basic"}},"antispam_v3":"1","store_spam_entries":"1","anti_spam":{"time_limit":{"enable":"1","duration":"2"},"filtering_store_spam":"1","country_filter":