eld_13">Magst Du uns sagen, was gefehlt hat?</label><textarea id="wpforms-25272-field_13" name="wpforms[fields][13]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-25272-field_13-error" aria-describedby="wpforms-25272-field_13-description" ></textarea>Was hätte es für Dich sicherer gemacht?<button\n					data-action="prev" data-page="2" data-formid="25272" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="wpforms-error-noscript">Zurück</button><button\n					data-action="next" data-page="2" data-formid="25272" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="wpforms-error-noscript">Weiter zu Seite 3 →</button><img src="https://spiritual-touch.de/wp-content/plugins/wpforms/assets/images/submit-spin.svg" style="display: none;" width="26" height="26" alt="Loading"><label for="wpforms-25272-field_33">Wer hat Dich begleitet?</label><select id="wpforms-25272-field_33" data-size-class="wpforms-field-row wpforms-field-small" data-search-enabled="1" name="wpforms[fields][33][]" multiple="multiple"><option value="" disabled >das Team</option><option value="Alea"   >Alea</option><option value="Amila"   >Amila</option><option value="Asmita"   >Asmita</option><option value="Dominik"   >Dominik</option><option value="Eva"   >Eva</option><option value="Ildiko"   >Ildiko</option><option value="Jen"   >Jen</option><option value="Jörg"   >Jörg</option><option value="Karen"   >Karen</option><option value="Konstantin"   >Konstantin</option><option value="Sarah"   >Sarah</option><option value="Stephanie"   >Stephanie</option><option value="Tara"   >Tara</option></select>Mehrfachauswahl möglich - z.b. für Paarmassagen<fieldset><legend>Wie stimmig war die Begleitung für Dich? *</legend><ul id="wpforms-25272-field_14"><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-25272-field_14_1" name="wpforms[fields][14]" value="Sehr stimmig" aria-errormessage="wpforms-25272-field_14_1-error" required ><label for="wpforms-25272-field_14_1">Sehr stimmig</label></li><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-25272-field_14_2" name="wpforms[fields][14]" value="Eher 