" data-formid="18955" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="wpforms-error-noscript">Weiter</button><fieldset><legend>Hast du bereits Erfahrung mit Körperarbeit / Tantra? *</legend><ul id="wpforms-18955-field_34"><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_34_1" name="wpforms[fields][34]" value="Ja" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_34_1-error" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_34_1">Ja</label></li><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_34_2" name="wpforms[fields][34]" value="nein" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_34_2-error" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_34_2">nein</label></li></ul></fieldset><label for="wpforms-18955-field_35">Wenn ja: Welche Erfahrungen bringst du mit? *</label><textarea id="wpforms-18955-field_35" name="wpforms[fields][35]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_35-error" required></textarea><label for="wpforms-18955-field_36">Gibt es etwas, das wir über Dich wissen sollten? *</label><textarea id="wpforms-18955-field_36" name="wpforms[fields][36]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_36-error" required></textarea><button\n					data-action="prev" data-page="5" data-formid="18955" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="wpforms-error-noscript">Zurück</button><button\n					data-action="next" data-page="5" data-formid="18955" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="wpforms-error-noscript">Weiter</button><fieldset><legend>Welchen Beitrag wählst du? *</legend><ul id="wpforms-18955-field_58"><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_58_1" name="wpforms[fields][58]" value="Solidarisch" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_58_1-error" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_58_1">Solidarisch</label></li><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_58_4" name="wpforms[fields][58]" value="Regulär" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_58_4-error" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_58_4">Regulär</label></li><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_58_3" name="wpforms[fields][58]" value="Fördernd" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_58_3-error" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_58_3">Fördernd</label></li></ul></fieldset><fieldset><legend aria-hidden="false">Checkboxen</legend><ul id="wpforms-18955-field_59"><li><input type="checkbox" id="wpforms-18955-field_59_1" name="wpforms[fields][59][]" value="Gender Pay Gap Beitrag (–15 %)" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_59_1-error"  ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_59_1">Gender Pay Gap Beitrag (–15 %)</label></li></ul></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Zahlungsmodell *</legend><ul id="wpforms-18955-field_51"><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_51_1" name="wpforms[fields][51]" value="Einmalzahlung" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_51_1-error" aria-describedby="wpforms-18955-field_51-description" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_51_1">Einmalzahlung</label></li><li><input type="radio" id="wpforms-18955-field_51_2" name="wpforms[fields][51]" value="Ratenzahlung" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_51_2-error" aria-describedby="wpforms-18955-field_51-description" required ><label for="wpforms-18955-field_51_2">Ratenzahlung</label></li></ul>Die genaue Höhe deiner Zahlung im Sliding-Scale-Modell wird nach der Anmeldung gemeinsam abgestimmt.</fieldset><label for="wpforms-18955-field_53">Ratenintervall</label><select id="wpforms-18955-field_53" name="wpforms[fields][53]"><option value="3 Monate"   >3 Monate</option><option value="6 Monate"   >6 Monate</option><option value="9 Monate"   >9 Monate</option><option value="12 Monate"   >12 Monate</option></select><fieldset><legend>Rechungsanschrift *</legend><input type="text" id="wpforms-18955-field_26" name="wpforms[fields][26][address1]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_26-error" required><label for="wpforms-18955-field_26">Adresse Zeile 1</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-18955-field_26-address2" name="wpforms[fields][26][address2]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-18955-field_26-address2-error" ><label for="wpforms-18955